{"tool_name":"scipion","contents":["biotools","oeb"],"identifiers":["biotools:scipion"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"scipion","home":"http://scipion.i2pc.es/","license":"GPL-2.0","summary":"A software framework for integrating several 3DEM software packages through a workflow-based approach. Scipion allows the execution of reusable, standardized, traceable and reproducible image-processing protocols. These protocols incorporate tools from different programs while providing full interoperability among them. Scipion is an open-source project that can be downloaded from http://scipion.cnb.csic.es.","addition_date":"2016-05-11T17:07:08Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T20:11:25.566359Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Desktop application","Workbench"],"version":["1","1.2","2.0","3.0"],"collections":["CNB-CSIC","INB"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:scipion","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"scipion@cnb.csic.es","name":"Scipion","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"],"url":"https://github.com/I2PC/scipion/wiki/Contact-Us"},{"name":"National Centre for Biotechnology  CNB-CSIC","typeEntity":"Institute","typeRole":["Provider"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"https://scipion-em.github.io/docs/docs/api/scipion-API.html"},{"type":["General"],"url":"https://scipion-em.github.io/docs/"},{"type":["Installation instructions"],"url":"https://scipion-em.github.io/docs/docs/scipion-modes/how-to-install.html"},{"type":["Training material"],"url":"https://scipion-em.github.io/docs/docs/user/user-documentation.html#tutorials"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"3D EM Mask","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_3806"}}],"note":"Workflow for 3D cryo EM image processing. Integrates several image processing software converting form one format to another.","operation":[{"term":"Data handling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2409"},{"term":"Microscope image visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3552"},{"term":"Protein geometry validation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_1844"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Structural profile","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0889"}}]}],"maturity":"Mature","name":"Scipion","operating_system":["Linux"],"owner":"p.conesa.mingo@gmail.com","publication":[{"doi":"10.1016/j.jsb.2016.04.010","metadata":{"abstract":"In the past few years, 3D electron microscopy (3DEM) has undergone a revolution in instrumentation and methodology. One of the central players in this wide-reaching change is the continuous development of image processing software. Here we present Scipion, a software framework for integrating several 3DEM software packages through a workflow-based approach. Scipion allows the execution of reusable, standardized, traceable and reproducible image-processing protocols. These protocols incorporate tools from different programs while providing full interoperability among them. Scipion is an open-source project that can be downloaded from http://scipion.cnb.csic.es.","authors":[{"name":"Abrishami V."},{"name":"Burguet-Castell J."},{"name":"Carazo J.M."},{"name":"Conesa P."},{"name":"Cuenca-Alba J."},{"name":"Foche I."},{"name":"Gomez-Blanco J."},{"name":"Gutierrez J."},{"name":"Kazemi M."},{"name":"Marabini R."},{"name":"Navas J."},{"name":"Oton J."},{"name":"Quintana A."},{"name":"Sharov G."},{"name":"Sorzano C.O.S."},{"name":"Vargas J."},{"name":"Vilas J.L."},{"name":"Zaldivar A."},{"name":"de la Rosa-Trevin J.M."},{"name":"del Cano L."}],"citationCount":386,"date":"2016-07-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Journal of Structural Biology","title":"Scipion: A software framework toward integration, reproducibility and validation in 3D electron microscopy"},"pmid":"27108186","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Electron microscopy","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611"},{"term":"Structure analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0081"}],"validated":1},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openeben